  "goodToKnow": "Amtierend means incumbent or reigning: der amtierende Kanzler, die amtierende Weltmeisterin, der amtierende Meister (the reigning champions, in the Bundesliga often Bayern Munich). Amtieren means to hold office, and kommissarisch amtieren means to serve in an acting capacity. Das Amt is an office or authority. Synonym for sport: der Titelverteidiger."
